OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AEx-gang boss found guilty in 1996
OL,4,Amurder of rapper Tupac Shakur
OL,5,
OL,6,FClad in a black suit, the 63-year-old
OL,7,Fstood impassively in the Las Vegas
OL,8,Fcourt as the verdict was read, before
OL,9,Fsaying he would appeal. Shakur's
OL,10,Frelatives held hands, some hugging and
OL,11,Fcrying.
OL,13,FShakur was 25 when he was slain at the
OL,14,Fheight of his career as one of rap's
OL,15,Fmost influential voices. He has sold
OL,16,Fmore than 75 million records worldwide.
